{"id":"2896ab0b2ebccfa4","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbclassinclusions.md","title":"Almost-positive、polar与切换类的关系","display":"thm-pbclassinclusions — Almost-positive、polar与切换类的关系","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbclassinclusions","aliases":["27-thm-pbclassinclusions"],"display":"thm-pbclassinclusions — Almost-positive、polar与切换类的关系","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]","[[27-df-submodular]]","[[27-df-pbderivative]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.4, Figures 13.1–13.3","source_printed_pages":"604–605","source_pdf_pages":"628–629","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbclassinclusions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbclassinclusions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbclassinclusions — Almost-positive、polar与切换类的关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18018df5c235cd7a\" href=\"?note=18018df5c235cd7a\" title=\"27-df-pbswitchclasses\">27-df-pbswitchclasses</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.4, Figures 13.1–13.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"604–605"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"628–629"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；各类与切换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18018df5c235cd7a\" href=\"?note=18018df5c235cd7a\" title=\"27-df-pbswitchclasses\">27-df-pbswitchclasses</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9c7a7ba711a14913\" href=\"?note=9c7a7ba711a14913\" title=\"27-df-submodular\">27-df-submodular</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\">\\(J_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a>。</p>\n<p>精确使用记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n,\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n,\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n,\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n,\\mathrm{PBSwitch}\">\\(\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n,\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n,\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n,\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n,\\mathrm{PBSwitch}\\)</span>，均沿用上述书内定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S,T\\subseteq[n]\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\quad\n\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S),T)=\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,(S\\setminus T)\\cup(T\\setminus S)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S,T\\subseteq[n]\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\quad\n\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S),T)=\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,(S\\setminus T)\\cup(T\\setminus S)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一次负项可改为负常数加正系数补文字，故almost-positive有polar posiform。纯正高次积和纯负高次积的任意二阶离散导数非负，线性与常数二阶导数为0；正和保持超模。切换复合按坐标异或，剩下包含关系分别取空切换或复合切换。没有添加图13.1中未证明的逆向包含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbswitchclasses","status":"resolved","id":"18018df5c235cd7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-submodular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbderivative]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbswitchclasses","status":"resolved","id":"18018df5c235cd7a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；各类与切换见 [[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]，$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$ 见 [[27-df-submodular]]，$J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-submodular","status":"resolved","id":"9c7a7ba711a14913","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；各类与切换见 [[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]，$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$ 见 [[27-df-submodular]]，$J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；各类与切换见 [[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]，$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$ 见 [[27-df-submodular]]，$J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"J_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n,\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n,\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n,\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n,\\mathrm{PBSwitch}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall S,T\\subseteq[n]\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\quad\n\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S),T)=\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,(S\\setminus T)\\cup(T\\setminus S)).","display":true}],"bytes":1933,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbclassinclusions|thm-pbclassinclusions — Almost-positive、polar与切换类的关系]]"}],"outgoing":["18018df5c235cd7a","9c7a7ba711a14913","3020cb523ec5a332"]}